|price = ¥765
}}

==Overview==
Fully compatible with the update!<br>
A 4-panel report on the life of the cats in "The Great Cat War"<br>
Includes [[Maiko Cat (Special Cat)|Maiko Cat]]'s Super Rare rubber strap

Includes an item code that allows you to play with "Maiko Cat" in the game<br>
Don't miss the evolution of the Maiko Cat, "Geisha Cat"

This is a fan book for the popular app "The Great Cat War", which has been downloaded 7 million times worldwide.<br>
The main points of this book are summarized in…….

*Complete support for the rare characters added in the [[Version 2.0 Update|August update]].
*A large number of setting materials that have never been seen before are disclosed.
*More than 100 illustrations of cat characters.
*Over 80 four-frame comics that reveal the ecology of the cats.
*More than 80 four-frame comics explaining the lives of the cat characters.
*More than 80 four-frame comics revealing the lives of the cat characters.
*Maiko Cat's Super Rare rubber strap is included.

This is a must-have item for all cat lovers.

